        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Nirvana\n- Albums: In Utero, in Tribute, in Entirety; In Utero; Sliver: The Best of the Box\n- Songs: Sliver\n- People: Franz Stahl, Dave Grohl, Chad Channing\n\nFacts:\n- Nirvana released In Utero as its third and final studio album.\n- In Utero, in Tribute, in Entirety was a tribute album to Nirvana’s album In Utero.\n- Nirvana’s song Sliver was rereleased on the album Sliver: The Best of the Box.\n- Sliver: The Best of the Box featured multiple artists, including Franz Stahl, Dave Grohl, and Chad Channing.",
